### Base URL Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Register New User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Developer",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "bio": "Full-stack developer interested in backend systems"
}

### 3. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Update Current User Profile (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Johnson (Updated)",
  "bio": "Lead Architect & Cloud Specialist"
}

### 6. Get All Blog Posts (with search, category, pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&limit=10&category=Technology

### 7. Search Blog Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?search=Node.js

### 8. Get Single Blog Post by ID or Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/mastering-modern-nodejs-architecture-in-2026

### 9. Create a New Blog Post (Protected)
# @name newPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mastering Microservices with Node.js and Docker",
  "category": "Technology",
  "tags": ["microservices", "docker", "nodejs"],
  "coverImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
  "content": "Microservices architectural patterns enable decoupled scaling, continuous deployment, and resilience..."
}

### 10. Toggle Like on Post (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{newPost.response.body.data.post._id}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Add Comment to Blog Post (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "{{newPost.response.body.data.post._id}}",
  "content": "Excellent guide! Very informative."
}

### 12. Get Comments for a Post
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/post/{{newPost.response.body.data.post._id}}

### 13. Get Current User's Posts (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
